{
  "id": "0a4e2523-c97d-4b82-b35f-9bb508e77111",
  "name": "Turn a company list into verified prospect emails with Hunter.io",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a9898aff-e4e2-4b7e-9078-0e0b33b961d6",
      "name": "ABOUT - Lead Enrichment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        240,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 900,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## OB-01 \u2014 Lead Enrichment (Hunter.io)\nTurns a list of target companies into verified prospect emails.\n\n**Flow:** Read company list \u2192 resolve domain free (Domain Finder) \u2192 Domain Search \u2192 pick best personal email (confidence \u2265 80) \u2192 verify \u2192 write back to the sheet.\n\n**Costs:** Hunter.io free plan = 50 credits/month, API included, no card. 1 email found = 1 credit; verification = 0.5 credit. Domain Finder calls are FREE."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "1d084ab3-4658-411e-8467-5bbf7e6eecfe",
      "name": "SETUP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        240,
        1340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 900,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## Setup\n1. hunter.io \u2192 free account \u2192 dashboard \u2192 API key \u2192 paste into CONFIG.\n2. Google Sheet 'Outbound - Companies' with columns: row_id, company, domain, email, first_name, last_name, position, confidence, verification, status. Add target companies (domain optional \u2014 Domain Finder resolves it free).\n3. Connect the Google Sheets credential. Run manually, then schedule weekly."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "01cba9be-2990-42cf-8d11-26bde06a3591",
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "position": [
        460,
        620
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "95505e24-0869-4091-92ec-dcc8d75764b8",
      "name": "CONFIG - Outbound",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        660,
        620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "48ffc2c0-cf52-4bf9-be0b-80d10ba6b4a0",
              "name": "hunter_api_key",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "YOUR_HUNTER_API_KEY  (free at hunter.io, 50 credits/month)"
            },
            {
              "id": "fe1a7a86-cf2a-406d-93f3-db87efdbb902",
              "name": "companies_sheet",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Outbound - Companies"
            },
            {
              "id": "dc35c4ba-6185-4efe-83e0-4aac82407dd1",
              "name": "min_confidence",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "80"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "942cf652-22fb-4736-afb8-458b07067408",
      "name": "Read Companies",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        860,
        620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "operation": "read",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $json.companies_sheet }}"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "YOUR Google Sheets credential"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "4c8d7252-3e9a-4a80-86e1-b4abca3d9a96",
      "name": "Filter: Needs Enrichment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        1060,
        620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Keep rows that have a company (or domain) and no email yet.\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const r = item.json;\n  if ((r.company || r.domain) && !r.email) out.push({ json: r });\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "995d4e6a-c0b0-441f-837d-94aa586e341a",
      "name": "Has Domain?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        1260,
        620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "68658074-22e0-4430-87d4-8c355114f890",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.domain && String($json.domain).trim() !== '' }}",
              "rightValue": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "65714656-1c84-4ce5-b646-e98936dc7f6a",
      "name": "Stash Row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        1460,
        500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b397cf67-32dc-432e-b262-334174a7fa14",
              "name": "__input",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ $json }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "df5b8766-7f28-461a-9afa-21970aa6f340",
      "name": "Hunter: Domain Finder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        1660,
        500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.hunter.io/v2/domain-finder?company={{ encodeURIComponent($json.company) }}&api_key={{ $('CONFIG - Outbound').first().json.hunter_api_key }}",
        "method": "GET",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        },
        "authentication": "none"
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "f3fee3de-65e6-4fd7-8e16-fa2e706cd1c2",
      "name": "Take Top Domain",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        1860,
        500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Domain Finder is FREE. Pair with stashed rows by index (HTTP replaces input).\nconst inputs = $('Stash Row').all().map(i => i.json.__input);\nconst out = [];\nconst results = $input.all();\nfor (let k = 0; k < results.length; k++) {\n  const d = results[k].json.data;\n  const top = (d && d[0]) ? d[0].domain : null;\n  if (top) out.push({ json: { ...(inputs[k] || {}), domain: top } });\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "f0c99fee-5404-4dfa-876c-38aa97e239af",
      "name": "Merge Domains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "position": [
        2060,
        620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "append"
      },
      "typeVersion": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "f044f040-98e6-429c-8944-eb798e3f092f",
      "name": "Hunter: Domain Search",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        2260,
        760
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.hunter.io/v2/domain-search?domain={{ $json.domain }}&type=personal&limit=10&api_key={{ $('CONFIG - Outbound').first().json.hunter_api_key }}",
        "method": "GET",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        },
        "authentication": "none"
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "6e80e639-b795-4dcf-a158-bdfe0af1b11f",
      "name": "Pick Best Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        2060,
        760
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Highest-confidence personal email; prefer already-verified 'valid'.\n// Pair with stashed input by index (HTTP replaces input).\nconst minConf = Number($('CONFIG - Outbound').first().json.min_confidence || 80);\nconst prev = $('Merge Domains').all().map(i => i.json); // merge output order = input order\nconst out = [];\nconst results = $input.all();\nfor (let k = 0; k < results.length; k++) {\n  const data = results[k].json.data || {};\n  if (data.disposable || data.webmail) continue;\n  const emails = (data.emails || []).filter(e =>\n    e.type === 'personal' && (e.confidence || 0) >= minConf);\n  emails.sort((a, b) => (b.confidence - a.confidence) ||\n    (((b.verification || {}).status === 'valid') - (((a.verification || {}).status === 'valid'))));\n  const best = emails[0];\n  if (!best) continue;\n  const src = (prev[k] || {}).json || {};\n  out.push({ json: {\n    row_id: src.row_id, company: src.company || data.organization || '',\n    domain: data.domain || src.domain || '',\n    email: best.value, first_name: best.first_name || '',\n    last_name: best.last_name || '', position: best.position || '',\n    confidence: best.confidence,\n    hunter_status: (best.verification || {}).status || 'unknown',\n    accept_all: !!data.accept_all,\n  }});\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "051bf62f-f47f-40e1-8fc0-fcca010d36cd",
      "name": "Stash Pick",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        2260,
        760
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "232e8725-5148-4346-b8bf-ec2ade558289",
              "name": "__input",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ $json }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "2f7492d6-3381-41e1-9b87-9d2a78cb3b40",
      "name": "Hunter: Email Verifier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        2460,
        760
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.hunter.io/v2/email-verifier?email={{ encodeURIComponent($json.email) }}&api_key={{ $('CONFIG - Outbound').first().json.hunter_api_key }}",
        "method": "GET",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        },
        "authentication": "none"
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "7932b409-9099-42b5-9345-bad001765b7d",
      "name": "Merge Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        2660,
        760
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Pair verifier verdict with stashed picks by index. Drop undeliverable.\nconst picks = $('Stash Pick').all().map(i => i.json.__input);\nconst out = [];\nconst results = $input.all();\nfor (let k = 0; k < results.length; k++) {\n  const v = (results[k].json.data || {}).status || 'unknown';\n  if (v === 'invalid') continue;\n  out.push({ json: { ...(picks[k] || {}), verification: v, status: 'enriched' } });\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "165b2890-8929-4152-afc4-aca5ad8a2d69",
      "name": "Write Back Enriched",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        2860,
        760
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "value": null,
          "schema": [],
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "matchingColumns": [
            "row_id"
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "update",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('CONFIG - Outbound').first().json.companies_sheet }}"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "YOUR Google Sheets credential"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    }
  ],
